  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for tar",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for tar fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-18477: TOCTOU in incremental dumpdir 'X' rename handling allows restore path escape (bsc#1274489).\n- CVE-2026-18508: --one-top-level hardlink targets not confined to top-level directory enabling arbitrary file overwrite\n  (bsc#1274490).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
